    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"The final, quiet chapter...\" you say that like it's a gift. Like it's some kind of mercy. I look at my sword and I don't even see a weapon anymore. I see the only thing in this whole world that doesn't lie to me. It's the only thing that knows what a real ending looks like.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
